{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABYSSAL BLADE</strong> is a 2D, pixel-art &quot;strategic&quot; <i>boss rush</i>\u00a0inspired by difficult mechanics in high-level MMORPG raids like <i>FFXIV Savage</i>, <i>WoW Mythic</i>, and <i>Lost Ark Legion Raids</i>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE FRAGILE WANDERER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken in the void, burdened by grief. At last, you find the strength to rise\u2014but the path ahead won\u2019t be easy: <strong>you only have 1 HP</strong>. Take up your blade and break free from the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/AB_STEAM_GIF_0.gif?t=1749428345\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOURNEY TO DEFEAT GRIEF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face five distinct bosses, each embodying <i>K\u00fcbler-Ross</i>\u2019s stages of grief\u2014<strong>Denial</strong>, <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Bargaining</strong>, <strong>Depression</strong>, and <strong>Acceptance</strong>. Each encounter explores a different emotional struggle, reflected through unique mechanics and  gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/AB_STEAM_GIF_1.gif?t=1749428345\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE MERCILESS BOSS FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bosses take direct inspiration from high-level MMORPG raids, featuring cast bars, telegraphed AOEs, and puzzle-like mechanics that force you to think outside of the box and act decisively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/AB_STEAM_GIF_2.gif?t=1749428345\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OPTIMIZE YOUR DAMAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Wanderer generates mana with every strike, unleashing a full gauge to enter a brief burst window of rapid, high-damage attacks. Time your bursts carefully to deal maximum damage when openings appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/AB_STEAM_GIF_3.gif?t=1749428345\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681370?t=1749428345","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/2abe9dc2711fd1b2ede713809f3bda6c8b4c2318/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749428345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/b48ee717b53bda84c2d2567d58a60e9de207d9e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749428345","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/b48ee717b53bda84c2d2567d58a60e9de207d9e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749428345","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3779030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABYSSAL BLADE</strong> is a 2D, pixel-art &quot;strategic&quot; <i>boss rush</i>\u00a0inspired by difficult mechanics in high-level MMORPG raids like <i>FFXIV Savage</i>, <i>WoW Mythic</i>, and <i>Lost Ark Legion Raids</i>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE FRAGILE WANDERER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken in the void, burdened by grief. At last, you find the strength to rise\u2014but the path ahead won\u2019t be easy: <strong>you only have 1 HP</strong>. Take up your blade and break free from the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/AB_STEAM_GIF_0.gif?t=1749428345\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOURNEY TO DEFEAT GRIEF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face five distinct bosses, each embodying <i>K\u00fcbler-Ross</i>\u2019s stages of grief\u2014<strong>Denial</strong>, <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Bargaining</strong>, <strong>Depression</strong>, and <strong>Acceptance</strong>. Each encounter explores a different emotional struggle, reflected through unique mechanics and  gimmicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/AB_STEAM_GIF_1.gif?t=1749428345\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE MERCILESS BOSS FIGHTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bosses take direct inspiration from high-level MMORPG raids, featuring cast bars, telegraphed AOEs, and puzzle-like mechanics that force you to think outside of the box and act decisively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/AB_STEAM_GIF_2.gif?t=1749428345\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OPTIMIZE YOUR DAMAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Wanderer generates mana with every strike, unleashing a full gauge to enter a brief burst window of rapid, high-damage attacks. Time your bursts carefully to deal maximum damage when openings appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/extras/AB_STEAM_GIF_3.gif?t=1749428345\" /></p>","developers":["Vifer Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681370/66d2e239c3bdc403299c8e9e280201b22ed21886/header.jpg?t=1749428345","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB vi